    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T18:29:26Z",
    "body": "[This PDF](https://www.fehlmann.com/fileadmin/redakteur/06_PDF_Zertifikate/PDF/Maschinenzubehoer_2611.pdf) has a list of all the tools available from Fehlmann themselves, with measurements. Attached a zipped step file of the holder taper, with the complete shape, drawn up by myself from caliper measurements and testing in the real spindle.\n\n[Fehlmann SF32.step.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/35362348/Fehlmann.SF32.step.zip)",
